  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Compsognathus longipes has a thin muzzle, elongate light trunk, long hindfeet and tapering tail. Body breadth, covering, colour and posture are inferred; partial fossil photographs and historical drawings do not establish an exact individual outline.",
    "zh": "美颌龙 Compsognathus longipes 具有纤细吻部、修长轻巧的躯干、长后足和收尖尾部。体宽、体表覆盖、颜色及姿态为推断；局部化石照片与历史绘图不能确定精确个体轮廓。"
  },
